name fig4latex
category Package
revision 26313
shortdesc Management of figures for large LaTeX documents
longdesc Fig4LaTeX simplifies management of the figures in a large LaTeX
longdesc document. Fig4LaTeX is appropriate for projects that include
longdesc figures with graphics created by XFig -- in particular,
longdesc graphics which use the combined PS/LaTeX (or PDF/LaTeX) export
longdesc method. An example document (with its output) is provided.
depend fig4latex.ARCH
runfiles size=2
 texmf-dist/scripts/fig4latex/fig4latex
catalogue-ctan /graphics/fig4latex
catalogue-date 2016-06-24 19:18:15 +0200
catalogue-license gpl3
catalogue-topics graphics-incl
catalogue-version 0.2
